                        <div>
                          <strong className="block mb-1 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-800">Secure Protocol Required</strong>
                          <p className="opacity-80">The automated transmission failed ({serverError}). To ensure your enquiry is received, please use one of these verified professional methods:</p>
